                                "sense_id": "aea401be-bf9a-34e8-a0cf-f6a7cb3c77f8",
                                "text": "But in the anticar movement, it is axiomatic that the urban model should be imposed everywhere."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dbc9f2b2-438d-497b-9519-bb2b8bdddfc0",
                                "sense_id": "aea401be-bf9a-34e8-a0cf-f6a7cb3c77f8",
                                "text": "But I don't think Eliot expected the kind of anticar sentiment that we're about."
                            }
                        ]
